<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
	<head>
		<%-include("../partials/header.ejs")%>
	</head>
	<body>
		<%-include("../partials/menu.ejs")%>
		<section class="main">
			<div class="scrollable">
				<h1>About</h1>

				<p>Blairpath is a web application that provides maps and route calculation for the campus of <a href="https://mbhs.edu/">Montgomery Blair High School (MBHS)</a>.</p>

				<section style="display: table; width: 100%">
					<div class="left">
						<h3>Team</h3>
						<p>Blairpath was founded and developed by <a href="https://jeffreytong.me/"><b>Jeffrey Tong</b></a> (MBHS Class of 2022).</p>
						<p><i>I plan to maintain Blairpath for the forseeable future.<br>~Jeffrey, August 2026</i></p>
					</div>
					<div class="right">
						<h3>Statistics</h3>
						<p>Curious what Blairpath means by vertices and edges? Learn <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Graph_theory">graph theory</a>.</p>
						<ul>
							<li><b><%-verticesArray.filter(v => v.section != "border" && v.section != "path").length%></b> places</li>
							<li><b><%-new Set(verticesArray.map(v => v.fxy.split(',')[0])).size%></b> floors</li>
							<li><b><%-verticesArray.length%></b> vertices</li>
							<li><b><%-diskData.edges.length%></b> edges</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</section>

				<h3>History</h3>
				<p><b>1998</b>: The present-day MBHS campus was completed. The architect wrote a <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20200222231349/http://www.designshare.com/HighSchoolLibrary/HSBlair/Blair2_Prog.htm">program summary</a>. They also shared their floor plans, which Blairpath's maps are based on (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20120205151339im_/http://www.designshare.com/HighSchoolLibrary/HSBlair/BlairSite.jpg">Site</a>, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160505145914im_/http://www.designshare.com/HighSchoolLibrary/HSBlair/blairpl1.jpg">Floor 1</a>, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160505225805im_/http://www.designshare.com/HighSchoolLibrary/HSBlair/blairpl2.gif">Floor 2</a>, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20120205151407im_/http://www.designshare.com/HighSchoolLibrary/HSBlair/blairpl3.gif">Floor 3</a>).</p>
				<p><b>2009</b>: The first known reference to the 4th floor (<a href="https://blairbash.org/1227">Blairbash Quote 1227</a>) was made. It became a running joke at the school.</p>
				<p><b>2019</b>: Jeffrey developed Blairpath as <a href="/demonstration">a project for a MBHS computer science class</a>, with most of the branding inspired by <a href="https://blairbash.org">Blairbash</a>. <a href="https://github.com/generalpoxter">Jason</a>, another student in the class, designed the 4th floor.</p>
				<p><b>2021</b>: Jeffrey started renting the domain www.blairpath.org. MBHS teacher Mr. Schwartz showed Blairpath to his 9th grade students to introduce them to campus.</li>

				<h3>Contributing</h3>
				<p>You can suggest changes to Blairpath's map by contacting a developer.</p>
				<p>If you're familiar with GitHub, you can submit new maps directly through a pull request:</p>
				<ol>
					<li>To learn how to edit the map, read the <a href="/devhelp">Blairpath Dev Tools Tutorial</a>.</li>
					<li>Submit a pull request to <a href="https://github.com/spiralsim/blairpath">spiralsim / <b>blairpath</b></a>.</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
		</section>
	</body>
</html>